ames 10–11, 24)\n  - On-screen graphics with Maury’s logo and show titles\n  - Split-screen interviews (frames 29–30) typical of talk shows\n  - Host Maury Povich seated in his signature chair (frames 7, 17, 27)\n\n---\n\n### ✅ **Location/Setting Determination:**\nThe setting is **clearly a television studio stage** — specifically, the set of the **Maury Povich show**. This is not a family counseling center, backstage area, or courtroom.\n\n- **Family counseling center?** ❌ No — no clinical furniture, no therapists, no private or therapeutic environment.\n- **Backstage?** ❌ No — the interaction is public, with an audience and cameras, and the set is fully lit and designed for broadcast.\n- **Courtroom?** ❌ No — no judge, no legal personnel, no formal legal procedures.\n- **On stage?** ✅ **YES** — this is a live television talk show set with a host, guests, audience, and dramatic confrontations.\n\n---\n\n### 🟩 Final Answer:\n**The correct location is “on stage” — NOT “family counseling center.”**\n\nTherefore, **answer ‘2’ is incorrect**. The setting is unmistakably a **television studio stage**, consistent with the Maury Povich show format."}, {'batch_start': 60, 'batch_end': 90, 'image_paths': ['/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/4LA_tH-VSnQ/frames/frame_0803.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/4LA_tH-VSnQ/frames/frame_0804.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/4LA_tH-VSnQ/frames/frame_0805.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/4LA_tH-VSnQ/frames/frame_0806.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/4LA_tH-VSnQ/frames/frame_0807.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/4LA_tH-VSnQ/frames/frame_0808.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/4LA_tH-VSnQ/frames/frame_0809.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/4LA_tH-VSnQ/frames/frame_0810.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/4LA_tH-VSnQ/frames/frame_0811.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/4LA_tH-VSnQ/frames/frame_0812.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/v